diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 562047b..d375e38 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -19,6 +19,8 @@ bin/serve
 
 The moderator interface is at `/moderate`; every page there uses HTTP Basic authentication. Quizzes can be imported from the quiz list and exported from their individual pages. The readiness endpoint is `/up`.
 
+A quiz's **Start a game** action snapshots its active questions into a new game and opens the moderator's live screen. Players use the generated `/play/:code` link; their browser identity is kept in an encrypted cookie, and their player record and answers are isolated per game. Turbo Streams broadcasts run over the SQLite-backed Solid Cable adapter, with a reconnect snapshot fallback for unreliable networks. QR codes are generated locally.
+
 ## Test
 
 ```sh
